# Alpine's community/vlc (_alpine below) with Raspberry Pi OS's patches
# (_rpi_patches, from
# https://github.com/RPi-Distro/vlc/tree/pios/<release>/debian/patches at
# _rpi_commit; Debian's own patches, listed before them, are left out),
# built as Raspberry Pi OS builds it for ARM: decoding through ffmpeg7's
# V4L2 hardware decoders (rpi/ffmpeg7), shown through DRM, EGL dmabuf
# import or Wayland's dmabuf protocol without copying the frames, and no
# VA-API, VDPAU or OpenMAX, which the Pi has none of. pkgver is Alpine's,
# plus _p and the patch set's number, so it ranks above Alpine's. Update it
# to Alpine's APKBUILD for the same _alpine with Raspberry Pi OS's patch set
# for that version; build-alpine-gnome-iso.sh stops when Alpine's vlc is no
# longer _alpine.
_alpine=3.0.23-r4
_rpi_commit=88272ce2fbf0ef1671ea64bda9eb6b44fdc4391f
